    "description": "\ufe0f\ud83c\udfb6 Do you want to change your voice to over 30 other funny voices?\r\n\ud83e\udd14Do you want to prank your friends with fake voices like robot, baby, bee...?\r\n\ud83d\udd25Do you want to share your video with funny voice effects on social networks?\r\n\ud83e\udd29 Are you looking for a free voice changer app with lots of funny voice and voice avatars?\r\n\r\nVoice Changer - Audio Effects will help you answer that question. This app is the best entertainment app that helps you change your voice to be interesting and funny. With more than 30+ voice effects, 10+ ambient sound effects, it will give you endless possibilities for creativity and customization.\r\n\r\nFuthermore, you can create cool voice effects, prank sound for your friends or share them on social networks. You can also edit awesome sounds and set them as free ringtone, alarm or notification to impress your friends.\r\n\r\nVoice Changer app is 100% free, has a beautiful interface and exports high sound quality. Therefore, the Voice Changer app is loved and appreciated by many users for entertainment. Just 2 steps to change the voice effect. Let's explore with us!\ufe0f\ud83c\udf88\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd11 Key Features of Voice Changer - Audio Effects: \ud83d\udd11\r\n\ud83c\udf99\ufe0f High-quality Recorder\r\n- Record and change your voice whenever and wherever possible with just one touch.\r\n- There is no limit on the maximum length of an audio file.\r\n- Funny voice changer app offers noise reduction with many modes.\r\n- Voice recording or built-in special effects let you change sound effects instantly.\r\n- The app provides parameters and audio effects to help you create interesting recordings.\r\n- Save recording files with high quality sound.\r\n\r\n\ufe0f\ud83c\udfb5 Change Voice for Audio\r\n- Easily change your voice into different voice avatar and voice effects.\r\n- 30+ funny voice changers like gender voice, zombie voice, robot voice, alien voice and monster voice etc.\r\n- With the help of ambient sounds, you can make the sound as if it happens in different places like in a cave, on a rainy day, on the meadow, in the forest etc.\r\n- Have fun with speed changer (custom effects with Tempo and pitch).\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa5 Change Voice for Videos \r\n- The Voice Changer with audio effects for Video can help change voice for video recorded or from a video file. \r\n- Test your voice with more than 50+ video voice dubbing effects.\r\n- Turn your voice in video into boys voice, girls voice with masculine level(simple mode), feminine level(simple mode) and manly, soft voice, pitch loud, voice tone (advance mode)\r\n- Create funny, trending videos with interesting voice effects to share voice over on social media.\r\n- Export videos with high quality.\r\n\r\n\ufe0f\ud83c\udfa7 Listen to great music\r\n- Voice Changer helps you have fun and relax moments with your love music. You can confidently sing your favorite songs with Karaoke effects.\r\n- Customizable sound with effects: echo, Reverb, pitch, tempo, volume, bass, mid, treble.\r\n- Apply more music effects like classic, treble, heavy, hip hop, dance, folk, jazz, pop,....Or you can adjust the bass, mids, reverbs to make your voice better.\r\n- Listen to great music with a bass booster.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd14 Cut audio files & Ringtone Maker\r\n- Cut the best part of MP3 quickly and accurately while keeping the original quality.\r\n- Edit and set your customized audio as ringtones, alarms, or notifications, adding a personal touch to your device.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Free voice changer app is a simple but complete-featured and smooth to use app. Choose from many funny voice effects to change your voice and create unforgettable moments. Let's share this audio changer & voice app with your friends!\ud83c\udf08\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc93 Download Voice Changer - Voice Effects for FREE now to experience it together!",
